{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問解答"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆泳ぐの好きなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分(笑)\n一人が行くっていったら皆行くのよ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泳ぎが一番上手いのは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワカチュキちゃんが上手かったよ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いってまさか野外？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違いますよ(笑)中です！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやにとって握手会はどんな存在？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会は凄く大切な存在！皆様と触れ合うコトが出来る最高のイベントです(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこのプール行ったの？今度会いに行ったときローラのモノマネしてくれるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近くのプール屋さん(笑)ローラのモノマネ〜！？練習するしか〜(焦)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒメタンは何を歌っているの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミサミサと一緒に『一年生〜になった〜ら♪』って歌ってた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バタフライは泳げるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バタフライはさすがに無理です(笑)\n授業のプールで泳いでたら〜先生におぼれてると思われ、助けられたことを思い出した(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シマムラって東京にあるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！あったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらくお嬢様風巻き髪ヘアーで行ってはどうでしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん！私はあんまり似合わなかったからなぁ(涙)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張してたっしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そっそっそりゃぁ緊張、したとも(汗)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の握手会で言ってたことほんと？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘だと思うの？悲しいよ〜(涙)本当だよ？\n今度会ったとき疑ったから覚えときなっ！フンッだッ！アハッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え〜っとこんなリアクションでいいでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダメ！もっと上手に(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふと方言が出ることある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある×２！何？って言われるもんw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プールってもうやってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近スマホにする人多いけど予定ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと同じ携帯だからそろそろ......。と思っているとこです(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅茶派？コーヒー派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅茶！コーヒーは苦い！大人の味がする(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはコロ×２ローラーやってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってるよ〜効果があまりわかんないケド...w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのプリ機が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかんない！教えて(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すこしふっくらした？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエットします！Sorry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや姫って呼ぼうかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーそんな×２(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＴVは乃木どこが録画出来るの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できるとも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番最初にまあやの部屋にお泊まりにきたメンバーは誰？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニャミよん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空気清浄機に吸われたアロマの香りは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ローズの香りです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京生活でこれは便利だと思ったことは？逆に困ったことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"便利→電車がいっぱい&駅がいっぱい！\n困る→電車の譲り合い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい学校凄く緊張とかしてたりする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"する×２皆仲良くしてくれるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また料理作ったののして？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手になったらねっ(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここだけは直したい恥ずかしいクセは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌いな食べ物とかはすぐ匂っちゃう(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメのアロマの香りは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香水みたいのじゃなかったら全部すき(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは『ほん呪 』ユーザーかい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その設定で書いたの〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お部屋は白っぽい感じなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！白が基本！少しピンク入れてる！\n以上！\n私のお部屋は皆様に貰ったものとかでイッパイになってきた〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんっと幸せっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんに抱きつかれた(照)キュン死にやぁぁぁ(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のblogでまあやの部屋紹介わすれてた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Sorry"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベッド"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴミ箱"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続きはまた今度ッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/7174462/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"}